WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Practice fighting slowly

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,860
From now on, please train me and I will train you, Sister Jiang Xue.

3
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:07,880
Can't you beat Brother Suhao?

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,680
He's ridiculously strong in close combat.

5
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,520
I can't even touch his sides

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,920
Only to be beaten

7
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,180
His hair is like snow

8
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,460
Still so curious

9
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,420
I’ll call you Aoxue from now on.

10
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,170
Aoxue is only three months old, right?

11
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:31,730
One bite can kill the hot pursuit

12
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:33,490
Worthy of being a plainclothes victor

13
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:35,050
Trigger side quests

14
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:36,090
granary of the apocalypse

15
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:38,930
Collect twenty different edible crop seeds

16
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:40,730
Generous rewards for completing the rally

17
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:45,470
My brother named him Aoxue, which sounds really nice.

18
00:00:46,190 --> 00:00:48,430
He is the youngest now.

19
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:54,480
He recognizes his master and his old self. If you stay with him more, he will recruit you and support you.
